html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":159632542,"discussion_id":"d2e5ae7fbf3ee74c493feb80cbd62c8b50443074","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:07+08:00","user":{"id":"67568c09b89449347da5fbc4","login":"wangbairu","object_id":"67568c09b89449347da5fbc4","name":"wangbairu ","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bd/fa/b3330534df7938af96d19bfc027f897f2f763e2370c58e23f7187afb9a3bb6df.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangbairu"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":159632551,"discussion_id":"5cebf1db46ac8efc44702ae31b4c39213ef20b1b","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":159632598,"discussion_id":"c86437e40012074b326cb0b0cabc0723b871e3e5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n优化卷积反向传播操作在特定场景下的输出后处理逻辑。原逻辑在处理输出张量为浮点数（FP32）且满足特定条件（`needSpecialCast`）时，采用固定的类型转换流程，可能不适用于其他输出数据类型（如FP16），存在潜在的正确性问题。本次修改旨在通过引入条件分支，使后处理逻辑能够适配不同的输出数据类型，确保其正确性和鲁棒性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n重构了`OutputPostProcess`函数中针对`needSpecialCast`场景的处理路径。核心修改是将原先单一的`Cast -> TransData -> Cast`流程，根据`outputTensor`的目标数据类型进行分支处理：当输出类型为`DT_FLOAT`时，保持原有流程；当输出为其他类型（如`DT_FLOAT16`）时，则采用更高效的`Cast -> TransData`流程。此方案避免了不必要的冗余类型转换，提升了处理效率，并确保了不同数据类型场景下逻辑的正确性。","created_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-12T19:27:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?t